{"id":3252,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为传承红色工业基因，感悟实业报国的民族精神，筑牢党员理想信念根基，飞行器设计与工程学生党支部组织党员前往宝鸡长乐塬抗战工业遗址开展主题党日研学活动。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NMzLTaLz7ZLz9bLtRLaUNCYMzQRozTj2LRnkMm9sMmUPUmG0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yaLYyiMkhkUNVfMNQfM8L8o7-8oRlbMzliMRlbL4U8L46FMm94M7UsLzTFM7lbMzGJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmNsgtA8pUwcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12297&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B0354BBAA6FA7C48B485955545934437/6834D719/4E950\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NMzLTaLz7ZLz9bLtRLaUNCYMzQRozTj2LRnkMm9sMmUPUmG0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yaLYyiMkhkUNVfMNQfM8L8o7-8oRlbMzliMRlbL4U8L46FMm94M7UsLzTFM7lbMzGJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmNsgtA8pUwcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12297&e=.jpg\"></p><p>长乐塬抗战工业遗址，是1938年民族企业家荣氏家族将申新纺纱厂内迁宝鸡建成的工业基地，林语堂誉其为“中国抗战工业奇迹”。活动伊始，在遗址入口的誓词广场，党员们面向党旗庄严宣誓，铿锵有力的入党誓词，叩问初心、淬炼党性。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NUNLTPn7LPMmLaMt7M2oz6fL49ZLzNjPnmvsUmV2L4CPM7C0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yYoShVMkyanRMfnNlYMR-YoRM7o7WfLmrVolWknmliL4nFMlMRMz7sM4MFMz6fU8LJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmNsgtA8pUwcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12297&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B29E40D3AFE242283D8BA25E9BBF5534/5CC51773/57ACC\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NUNLTPn7LPMmLaMt7M2oz6fL49ZLzNjPnmvsUmV2L4CPM7C0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yYoShVMkyanRMfnNlYMR-YoRM7o7WfLmrVolWknmliL4nFMlMRMz7sM4MFMz6fU8LJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmNsgtA8pUwcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12297&e=.jpg\"></p><p>随后党员们依次走进窑洞车间、薄壳车间、申新纱厂办公楼等历史遗存。纵深绵延的窑洞车间共有24孔窑洞，上方覆盖三十余米厚黄土层，凭借得天独厚的隐蔽性，躲避日军轰炸，成为抗战时期规模最大的地下工厂。八十余年前，工人们于昏暗的窑洞之内，依靠纱锭织就希望，在炮火硝烟中坚持生产，源源不断输出棉纱棉布，撑起战时的生命线。斑驳锈蚀的纺织设备、青砖砌筑的窑壁，无声诉说着绝境之中，中华民族不屈不挠的坚韧力量。走出窑洞，陇海铁路线上和谐号列车呼啸而过，今昔对照，更让全体党员心生感慨。</p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NLNlTPUlnVL8LsotR7iLzLsLmTVL4UjDL4N4Lzv8M8CDnlU0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhRLky8M1yinz9aM4-anN-YM8MRM4UsL77Dn7C8Lzv4Lm6FozGDU4vPn7MFLmvsMlLJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmNsgtA8pUwcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12297&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4C0465E80720FB27CC7470A6DF417327/906C71DC/2775C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NLNlTPUlnVL8LsotR7iLzLsLmTVL4UjDL4N4Lzv8M8CDnlU0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhRLky8M1yinz9aM4-anN-YM8MRM4UsL77Dn7C8Lzv4Lm6FozGDU4vPn7MFLmvsMlLJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmNsgtA8pUwcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12297&e=.jpg\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NUmWTRU8lanN7sLtmMfolL8nlnRnRCjaMRG8nzQ7nRTVo7U0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyPokhfMkhfMN-4nmlinRW2oR9PL7M2L7CDU4LPolUPL4MFL4CDoRvDLmMFMRAfLRCJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmNsgtA8pUwcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12297&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/318A4A6B3F55D2F8810CF0F6C319D133/36687623/48A06\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NLRvTiUlUYLR94MtRT2nRGiMRUiUmnjVozvaMmGPUm6Vol70gihFp2hmCIa0M1yZokhRMkyPMNlZoRV7MzQVLz6fn7lanmfVUN-PL4CinRQFnmn7oz7YLmQFLz7aUl-YgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLm-bMYbw62w8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12297&e=.jpg\"></div></td></tr><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NnzfT2M8Q7UN7botllbol-anRliLmWjfLRCinRvbUNrRLm70gihFp2hmCIa0MkyiLYhRLSy4Lz-ZMlCaLlWRozGbM4vYM7LZnmCZo7LDUmVFLNQRUm7anzAFL4v4MmlJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmNsgtA8pUwcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12297&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/453C131285F01BC9097724C8F688C6B1/2FCB10E8/37365\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NnzfT2M8Q7UN7botllbol-anRliLmWjfLRCinRvbUNrRLm70gihFp2hmCIa0MkyiLYhRLSy4Lz-ZMlCaLlWRozGbM4vYM7LZnmCZo7LDUmVFLNQRUm7anzAFL4v4MmlJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmNsgtA8pUwcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12297&e=.jpg\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NUzvT8U4CPLz7aMt7Q7LNLio7WfnzGjsMN-4nN7iU4GZLl70gihFp2hmCIa0MYyboSyPUYhfLl7DMzMkLz6VLRU4MRnkoRvDM8VVU4C4o7nFLRfkozGinlnFL8-8M7UJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmNsgtA8pUwcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12297&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7991CA1A653B17E04344B8767AEC638D/00B905ED/3B44D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NUzvT8U4CPLz7aMt7Q7LNLio7WfnzGjsMN-4nN7iU4GZLl70gihFp2hmCIa0MYyboSyPUYhfLl7DMzMkLz6VLRU4MRnkoRvDM8VVU4C4o7nFLRfkozGinlnFL8-8M7UJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmNsgtA8pUwcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12297&e=.jpg\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p>一段峥嵘工业史，一曲民族奋斗歌。本次实地研学，让全体党员沉浸式体悟烽火岁月里实业救国的家国情怀。大家纷纷表示，将传承先辈不畏艰难、奋勇争先的精神，以实际行动践行党员使命担当。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NoRlTbL4VknRVkUt4-PMmv8Lzv8o7UjYM7Q2UmLiLlUinzv0gihFp2hmCIa0okyaMkh2M1yDMNC4L4rRnN-ZnNW7MzUPUmUZM7M2MRNZLNQFoRA7UNV2nmTFMlV2MR7Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmNsgtA8pUwcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12297&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/804F666F335CFB8FBD541B484CF4982F/88DBAFF9/5AF41\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NoRlTbL4VknRVkUt4-PMmv8Lzv8o7UjYM7Q2UmLiLlUinzv0gihFp2hmCIa0okyaMkh2M1yDMNC4L4rRnN-ZnNW7MzUPUmUZM7M2MRNZLNQFoRA7UNV2nmTFMlV2MR7Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmNsgtA8pUwcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12297&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NMzLTaLz7ZLz9bLtRLaUNCYMzQRozTj2LRnkMm9sMmUPUmG0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yaLYyiMkhkUNVfMNQfM8L8o7-8oRlbMzliMRlbL4U8L46FMm94M7UsLzTFM7lbMzGJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmNsgtA8pUwcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12297&e=.jpg"}